OL,5,G2200 The Catch
OL,6,     FEd discovers that someone is
OL,7,     Fspying on him and knows a dark
OL,8,     Fsecret from his past. Meanwhile,
OL,9,     FBob informs Ed that he saw George
OL,10,     Fon CCTV, heading to the boat. Is
OL,11,     Fhe behind the sabotage? (Ep2/4)
OL,12,G2300 The Catch
OL,13,     FThe thriller continues. More
OL,14,     Fevidence about George emerges, but
OL,15,     FEd is warned to leave the past
OL,16,     Falone. A body is washed up in the
OL,17,     Fharbour, and Ed finds himself in
OL,18,     Fthe frame for murder... (Ep3/4)
