OL,5,G0000 The Catch
OL,6,     FAs the thriller concludes, Ed is
OL,7,     Fin hiding and his family don't
OL,8,     Fknow what to believe. When the
OL,9,     Ftruth is finally exposed, Ed must
OL,10,     Fmeet his nemesis alone - will his
OL,11,     Fsins cost him his life? (Ep4/4)
OL,12,G0100 Taggart
OL,13,     FWhen a tormented schoolboy is
OL,14,     Ffound dead in the grounds of his
OL,15,     Fschool, suicide appears to be
OL,16,     Fcause. However, it soon becomes
OL,17,     Fapparent that his death was no
OL,18,     Faccident.
